{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom liquid block called "Nuevos productos carrusel". Display all store products sorted by newest first using collections.all.products with sort_by: created-descending. Do NOT use a collection picker.
    
    CRITICAL — HTML structure (mandatory, do not change): The carousel must use exactly 3 nested containers:
    
    outer-wrapper (overflow: visible, padding: 0)
      └── clip-wrapper (overflow: hidden, margin-top: -32px, margin-bottom: -32px)
            └── scroll-container (overflow-x: auto, padding: 32px 40px, scrollbar-width: none)
                  └── flex-row (display: flex, gap: 16px)
                        └── cards
    outer-wrapper: overflow: visible; width: 100%; padding: 0;
    clip-wrapper: overflow: hidden; width: 100%; margin-top: -32px; margin-bottom: -32px; — compensates for scroll-container's vertical padding to collapse extra space without clipping shadows
    scroll-container: overflow-x: auto; padding: 32px 40px; scrollbar-width: none; scroll-behavior: smooth; — vertical padding (NOT negative margin) creates breathing room for top/bottom shadows
    flex-row: display: flex; flex-direction: row; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; gap: 16px;
    This structure is the only correct way to show vertical shadows while preventing mobile zoom-out and avoiding the white line/gap that cuts the shadow. Do not simplify or alter it.
    
    Carousel behavior:
    
    Mobile: 2 cards visible side by side, swipe LEFT/RIGHT
    Desktop (min-width 750px): 4 cards visible
    scroll-snap-align: start on each card
    Hide scrollbar: scrollbar-width: none + ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none }
    Image format:
    
    Fixed height controlled by image_height setting (default 300px)
    Image container: height: {{ block.settings.image_height }}px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    Image inside: position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    Border-radius from card_border_radius setting
    On hover: transform: scale(1.08) with transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Ultra-premium animations:
    
    Page load — staggered entrance per card:
    
    From: opacity: 0; transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97)
    To: opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1)
    Duration: 0.7s, easing: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), animation-fill-mode: both
    Stagger: 100ms delay per card using nth-child loop
    Hover state:
    
    Card: transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02)
    Background → hover_background_color
    Texts → hover_text_color
    Shadow intensifies smoothly
    All transitions: 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Shadow transition declared separately: box-shadow 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Active/press state: transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.00)
    
    Text: all card text always text-align: center
    
    Card sizing:
    
    Mobile: flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px)
    Desktop: flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px)
    Theme editor settings:
    
    Heading:
    
    heading_text — text, default "Nuevos productos"
    heading_color — color picker
    heading_size — range 16–48, default 24
    heading_alignment — select left/center/right, default center
    Card texts:
    
    card_title_color — color picker
    card_title_size — range 12–24, default 14
    card_price_color — color picker
    card_price_size — range 12–22, default 14
    card_vendor_color — color picker
    show_price — checkbox, default true
    show_vendor — checkbox, default false
    Image:
    
    image_height — range, min: 100, max: 400, step: 10, default: 300, label: "Altura de imagen (px)"
    Hover colors:
    
    hover_background_color — color picker, default #1a1a1a
    hover_text_color — color picker, default #ffffff
    Shadow — normal:
    
    shadow_color — color picker, default #000000
    shadow_opacity — range 0–30, default 8
    shadow_offset_x — range -20 to 20, default 0
    shadow_offset_y — range 0–30, default 6
    shadow_blur — range 0–80, default 20
    shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 0
    Shadow — hover:
    
    hover_shadow_opacity — range 0–40, default 20
    hover_shadow_blur — range 0–100, default 40
    hover_shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 4
    hover_shadow_offset_y — range 0–40, default 12
    Card layout:
    
    card_background — color picker, default #ffffff
    card_border_radius — range 0–32, default 14
    card_padding — range 8–32, default 14
    products_to_show — range 4–24, default 8
    Sale price (CRITICAL):
    
    Each product card must show compare-at price and current price when applicable:
    
    If product.compare_at_price > product.price, show compare-at price above the current price
    Compare-at price: text-decoration: line-through; font-size: 85% of card_price_size; opacity: 0.55; — reads as "precio anterior"
    Current price: below, in normal card_price_color and card_price_size
    Use money_with_currency filter for both prices
    On hover, both prices inherit hover_text_color
    Non-negotiable requirements:
    
    Use the exact 3-container structure described above — no simplifications
    Images always object-fit: cover, overflow hidden
    All text always centered
    No hardcoded colors or shadow values — all from settings
    Layout always horizontal
    All easings cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) for premium feel
    body must NOT have overflow-x: hidden added — fix must be structur
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign all_products = collections.all.products | sort: 'created_at' | reverse %}

{% style %}
  .ai-nuevos-productos-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: visible;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: -32px;
    margin-bottom: -32px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 48px 10px;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97);
    animation: ai-nuevos-productos-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), background-color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_spread }}px rgba({{ block.settings.shadow_color.red }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color.green }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color.blue }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px);
    }
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.hover_background_color }};
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_spread }}px rgba({{ block.settings.shadow_color.red }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color.green }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color.blue }}, {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.00);
  }

  {% for i in (1..24) %}
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child({{ i }}) {
      animation-delay: {{ i | minus: 1 | times: 100 }}ms;
    }
  {% endfor %}

  @keyframes ai-nuevos-productos-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height }}px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_vendor_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size | times: 0.85 | round }}px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_price_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size | times: 0.85 | round }}px;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.55;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_price_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size }}px;
    margin: 0;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

<nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nuevos-productos-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading_text != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-nuevos-productos-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_text }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for product in all_products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
            <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if product.featured_image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    class="ai-nuevos-productos-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="{{ block.settings.image_height }}"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: #f4f4f4;"></div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.show_vendor and product.vendor != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
                {% endif %}

                <h3 class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>

                {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                  <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                      <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                        {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}
                      </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ product.price | money }}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class NuevosProductosCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.scrollContainer = this.querySelector('.ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (this.scrollContainer) {
          this.setupScrollBehavior();
        }
      }

      setupScrollBehavior() {
        let isDown = false;
        let startX;
        let scrollLeft;

        this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {
          isDown = true;
          startX = e.pageX - this.scrollContainer.offsetLeft;
          scrollLeft = this.scrollContainer.scrollLeft;
        });

        this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          isDown = false;
        });

        this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {
          isDown = false;
        });

        this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
          if (!isDown) return;
          e.preventDefault();
          const x = e.pageX - this.scrollContainer.offsetLeft;
          const walk = (x - startX) * 2;
          this.scrollContainer.scrollLeft = scrollLeft - walk;
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', NuevosProductosCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

